                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I absolutely love this game! It pleasantly surprised me in a lot of ways, almost completely. For the type of game it is, and the price of the game, it is incredibly visually detailed. The gameplay is very solid, and fluid, while clearly its meant to just have causual fun, it can get pretty intense and competitive. Full disclaimer though I did recieve this game for free, but I think it's well deserving of all the praise it is receiving. From the upgrade system, to the gun fight mechanics, to the differences bewteen the 2 factions. This game is actually pretty fun! It even has controller support! Something I feel most pc developers leave out. And the dev team are so nice, and helpful, and very transparent, they aren't afraid of criticism or tough questions. There has been bugs reported, but I haven't ran into many bugs myself, the game is very stable. Overall this game is awesome, and I highly recommend it.",
